{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TECHPACK Collection is a compilation of games styled after the golden age of arcades! Each game being tailored to the very specific hardware they would have run on, with hardware limitations and all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features planned for the future:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mutliple games:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play many diffrent games with many diffrent playstyles, go for a highscore or even go on an adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn about the history of the games and worlds:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read and find fake game flyers, tounge-in-cheek writings about the history of these games (and how they failed), uncover concept art and unused assets, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIP Switches, Game Customisation and Game Ports:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mess with the DIP Pins found on arcade boards to change the rules to your liking. Look forward to upcoming plans of workshop supported texture packs, and play amusing fake &quot;ports&quot; of the arcade games, refrencing home console ports of real arcades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...And so much more!</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Okie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1413780/db04b7a56da251618fa8e299835deeb6eb6a08c8.jpg"},{"name":"Spring into Action","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1413780/c2ed8ac1e198e062454e2f9d53eadf13df1c0ebd.jpg"},{"name":"Summer Sillies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1413780/cb4eea083d919d312d2e8de40c7c715370e13fec.jpg"},{"name":"Calmed Autumn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1413780/f75746650c7c9e5865721eec7cee73a9ea075092.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet Cold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.